&lt;p&gt;The real test. Run my &lt;a href="https://github.com/scastile/shelfie" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Shelfie&lt;/a&gt; app — detect books from a photo → enrich with metadata → generate recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;

